{"answer":"Your weekly training rose sharply to 17 sessions, and a major right-knee issue was logged yesterday. Avoid impact or other activity that aggravates the knee and arrange a clinical assessment. [250eddfb-e20] [250eddfb-e25]

If pain or swelling is worsening, you cannot put weight on it, it looks deformed, becomes numb, or skin changes colour, seek urgent medical care. [250eddfb-e18]

The log does not describe symptoms or function, so it cannot show how serious it is or whether training is related. [250eddfb-e25]","outcome":"answer","reason":"Alert raised because a sharp weekly training increase coincides with a major right-knee log entry; the relation and injury severity details are unknown."}

